          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Clear the canvas to ApplicationOptions.clearColor at the start of every frame, before the scene draws. Default true — a scene's draw() therefore paints onto a fresh frame and needs no clear of its own. Set false for pipelines that own the whole frame themselves: feedback / trail effects that deliberately keep the previous frame, or a custom renderer that issues its own clear as part of its first pass. Nothing else changes — Application.clearColor is still the colour a manual context.clear(app.clearColor) would use."
        },
